`test/datetime/plus.test.js` does not exist in this repo. The equivalent file is **`test/datetime/math.test.js`**, which already contains `DateTime#plus works across the 100 barrier` (and the `minus` counterpart). I did not add/remove/edit any test permanently; I used a temporary test file to reproduce the hidden test and deleted it afterwards.

